From: Pavle012 <pavle@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 12:17:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Repair line-ending-only migration checksum mismatches

SQLx hashes migration files byte-for-byte, so CRLF databases can fail to
open when a release embeds the same migration with LF line endings. Repair
only checksums that match an exact LF/CRLF conversion of the current SQL.
---
